       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-CORE-THEOREMS-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TF-CORE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-XLA-HLO-FUSION-EQUIV     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REVERSE-ADJOINT-CLOSURE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TFDATA-QUEUE-BOUNDED     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AUTOGRAPH-STATE-INVAR    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QAT-FIXED-POINT-CONSERVE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TF-THEOREMS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TF-THEOREMS-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-THEOREMS-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-OPTIMIZATIONS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DATA-AND-CONTROL.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-QUANTIZATION.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-TF-THEOREMS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-OPTIMIZATIONS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-XLA-HLO-FUSION-EQUIV.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REVERSE-ADJOINT-CLOSURE.
       2000-EVALUATE-DATA-AND-CONTROL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TFDATA-QUEUE-BOUNDED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AUTOGRAPH-STATE-INVAR.
       3000-EVALUATE-QUANTIZATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QAT-FIXED-POINT-CONSERVE.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-TF-THEOREMS.
           IF WS-XLA-HLO-FUSION-EQUIV = 1 AND
              WS-REVERSE-ADJOINT-CLOSURE = 1 AND
              WS-TFDATA-QUEUE-BOUNDED = 1 AND
              WS-AUTOGRAPH-STATE-INVAR = 1 AND
              WS-QAT-FIXED-POINT-CONSERVE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TF-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-THEOREMS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TF-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-THEOREMS-CODE.
